se above 21.31 proves it wrong (armed, waiting for the trigger). Desk backtest for W7: negative (-0.14R over 1280 trades)."},"scores":{"overall":53,"group":"SIC 61 Credit Institutions","group_rank":5,"group_n":20,"sector_rank":65,"sector_n":424,"earn":52}},"biz":{"name":"PRA Group, Inc.","desc":"PRA Group Inc is a specialty finance company engaged in the purchase, collection, and management of nonperforming loan portfolios. The majority of the loans it purchases are from credit originators who have chosen not to pursue, or have been unsuccessful in collecting, the full balance owed to them (Core accounts). To a lesser extent, the company also purchases loans in situations where the customer is involved in a bankruptcy or similar proceeding (Insolvency accounts). As part of an ancillary business, it also purchases and provides fee-based services for class action claims recoveries in the U.S. The company has two operating and reportable segments, comprised of its U.S. and European businesses. The majority of its revenue is generated from the United States.","desc_src":"Massive (formerly Polygon.io) ticker details","sic":"6153","sic_desc":"Short-Term Business Credit Institutions","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","mcap":710041393.16,"mcap_src":"Massive ticker details (2026-10-03)","shares":37648006,"shares_src":"Massive ticker details (share-class shares outstanding)","hq":"NORFOLK, VA","website":"https://www.pragroup.com","employees":2615,"list_date":"2002-11-08","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1185348,"state_inc":"DE","massive_asof":"2026-10-03","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":216430000.0,"rev_yoy":-11.6,"eps":-0.31,"eps_yoy":-149.2,"ni":-12262000.0,"ni_yoy":-149.6,"nm":-5.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":221418000.0,"rev_yoy":-0.6,"eps":-0.22,"eps_yoy":-152.4,"ni":-8305000.0,"ni_yoy":-152.5,"nm":-3.8,"derived":